                class="img-fluid rounded">

    </div>

    <div class="col-md-7">

        <h2>Whyu did I choose these characters?</h2>

        <p>
            I specifically chose these five characters mainly because they
            all represent some of my favorite characters from each phase of my life.
            As a kid I was always and still am a Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles fan.
            My favorite has always been Raphael.
            Since I was a kid Batman has always been my favorite superhero and character so that was an easy choice.
            I have just only really cared about spiderman ever since Tom Holland began playin him in the MCU,
            so I haven't been a fan for as long as some of the other characters I chose, but the new movie was incredible
            in my opinion and I love Tom Holland.
            Winston is a character from my current favorite game so I am not the most knowledgeable about him but he is the best.
            Darth Vader is jsut an easy choice because I recently have gotten in to star wars a lot more and he is an iconic character to choose.
            Over the last month or so I have begun to read comics with these character in them and that is primarily how they all relate to fit into this character gallery.

        </p>

    </div>

